                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Dimple came to Charlotte with two suitcases and built a career as a Certified Public Accountant before her neighbors asked her to serve. She raises two children here, drives the same congested roads, and pays the same rising bills. That is the vantage point she brings to every vote: not a theory about Charlotte, but a life lived in it.",
